---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SOCIAL_LINKS } from '../consts';
---

<Base title="About" description="Software architect, engineering manager, blogger, mentor and Taekwondo black belt.">
	<h1>About</h1>
	<p class="lede">Software architect, engineering manager, blogger and Taekwondo black belt.</p>

	<p>
		I'm a Technical Architect at Provus, based in Bengaluru, with 15+ years in software engineering,
		including roles as an Engineering Manager and Technical Lead. I designed and built CPQ Express, a
		platform for pricing and quoting, and I've spent my career building platforms in .NET, React and
		Azure/AWS. I hold MCSD and MCSA certifications. I care about systems where the pieces fit together
		cleanly, an idea I borrow from the fluidity of martial arts.
	</p>
	<p>
		Beyond coding, I care about sharing what I learn. As a mentor, I help other developers on their
		own journeys, and this blog is part of that.
	</p>
	<p>
		When I'm not writing code, you'll find me on the mats. The discipline and focus I've built there
		shape how I approach programming problems.
	</p>
	<p>
		<a href="/blog/">Browse my writing</a> on programming, software design and technology.
	</p>

	<h2>Get in touch</h2>
	<ul>
		{
			SOCIAL_LINKS.map((l) => (
				<li>
					<a href={l.href} rel="me noopener" target="_blank">
						{l.label}
					</a>
				</li>
			))
		}
	</ul>
</Base>

<style>
	.lede {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: var(--muted);
	}
</style>
